incubators, university business programs and angel investors. Your founders and students get a free one-month supply of PDRN Brightening Serum, free of charge, no strings attached.\",\n    \"isPartOf\": {\n      \"@id\": \"https://tavalabs.app/#website\"\n    },\n    \"publisher\": {\n      \"@id\": \"https://tavalabs.app/#organization\"\n    },\n    \"inLanguage\": \"en-US\"\n  }\n]\n"], "scripts": [{"src": "https://ajax.googleapis.com/ajax/libs/webfont/1.6.26/webfont.js"}, {"src": "/page-scripts/partners-33.js"}, {"src": "/page-scripts/partners-34.js"}, {"src": "https://d3e54v103j8qbb.cloudfront.net/js/jquery-3.5.1.min.dc5e7f18c8.js?site=6261782397372d8306f031ca"}, {"src": "/tava-webflow.js"}, {"src": "/page-scripts/partners-35.js"}, {"src": "https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/smoothscroll/1.4.10/SmoothScroll.min.js"}, {"src": "/page-scripts/partners-36.js"}, {"src": "/page-scripts/partners-37.js"}, {"src": "/page-scripts/partners-38.js"}], "bodyClass": "body", "htmlAttrs": {"data-wf-domain": "tavalabs.app", "data-wf-page": "6261782397372dac68f031c9", "data-wf-site": "6261782397372d8306f031ca"}, "contentHtml": "\n<div class=\"section wf-section\"><div class=\"tava-page\">\n<style>\n.tava-page{max-width:880px;margin:0 auto;padding:64px 24px 24px;font-family:'Futura book font',sans-serif;color:#000000}\n.tava-page .tp-eyebrow{letter-spacing:.22em;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#B78B45;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0 0 14px}\n.tava-page h1{font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:42px;line-height:1.15;color:#000000;margin:0 0 18px}\n.tava-page h2{font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:26px;color:#000000;margin:38px 0 10px}\n.tava-page p,.tava-page li{font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.65;color:#000000}\n.tava-page a{color:#B78B45}\n.tava-page .tp-lede{font-size:19px;line-height:1.6}\n.tava-page .tp-card{background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #D8C19A;border-radius:16px;padding:22px 24px;margin:18px 0}\n.tava-page .tp-gift{background:#000000;border-radius:16px;padding:26px 28px;margin:26px 0}\n.tava-page .tp-gift h2{color:#D8C19A;margin:0 0 10px}\n.tava-page .tp-gift p{color:#FFFFFF;margin:0}\n.tava-page .tp-partner{margin:34px 0}\n.tava-page .tp-partner img{width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:16px;display:block;margin:0 0 18px}\n.tava-page .tp-cta{display:inline-block;background:#000000;color:#FFFFFF!important;padding:13px 26px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:13.5px;text-decoration:none;margin:8px 10px 8px 0}\n.tava-page .tp-cta.alt{background:#000000;color:#FFFFFF!important}\n.tava-page ul{padding-left:20px}\n.tava-page ol{padding-left:20px}\n.tava-page .tp-fine{font-size:13.5px;color:#7A7261}\n</style>\n\n<p class=\"tp-eyebrow\">Partners</p>\n<h1>Partner with Tava Labs.</h1>\n<p class=\"tp-lede\">Give the founders in your program a standard for how they present themselves, starting on day one.</p>\n<p class=\"tp-lede\">We partner with accelerators and incubators and university business programs and professors and angel investors and mentors. If you run a program or teach founders or back them, we want to put Tava Labs in the hands of your founders and students, as a gift from us for joining you.</p>\n\n<div class=\"tp-gift\">\n<h2>A free month, on us, with no strings attached.</h2>\n<p>As a partnership, we will give a free one month supply of our PDRN Brightening Serum to your students or founders, free of charge and with no strings attached. You give it to them as a gift from us, just for joining your program or your class or your cohort.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"tp-partner\">\n<img src=\"/assets/partners/IMG_3360.jpeg\" alt=\"Founders working together in an accelerator program\"/>\n<h2>Accelerators &amp; Incubators</h2>\n<p>For accelerator and incubator programs that bring founders together to build and launch and grow. Add Tava Labs to your cohort experience. Every founder who joins your program gets a free one month supply of our serum from us, as a welcome gift. Your founders are pitching and selling and recording from the first week, and their appearance is part of their professional presence. This gift helps them look prepared and composed while they do it.</p>\n<p>How it works. Tell us about your program and your next cohort, we arrange the free one month supply for your founders, and you hand it out as a gift from Tava Labs when they join.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"tp-partner\">\n<img src=\"/assets/partners/IMG_3358.jpeg\" alt=\"A university professor teaching business students in a lecture hall\"/>\n<h2>Universities &amp; Business Professors</h2>\n<p>For university professors of business majors and the programs behind them. Partner with Tava Labs and your students get a free one month supply of our PDRN Brightening Serum, free of charge, as a gift from us just for joining your class or program. It is an easy and no cost addition for entrepreneurship and business students who are building and presenting and preparing to pitch, and who are learning that personal presentation is part of professional life.</p>\n<p>How it works. Reach out with your class or program details, we arrange the free one month supply for your students, and you give it to them as a gift from Tava Labs.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"tp-partner\">\n<img src=\"/assets/partners/IMG_3359.jpeg\" alt=\"An angel investor and mentor meeting with founders\"/>\n<h2>Angel Investors &amp; Mentors</h2>\n<p>For angel investors and mentors who support early founders. Through a partnership with Tava Labs, the founders you back or mentor get a free one month supply of our serum, free of charge and with no strings attached, as a gift from us that you can pass on to them. A small and thoughtful extra for founders in your portfolio as they pitch and sell and show up on camera.</p>\n<p>How it works. Tell us who you would like to gift it to, we arrange the free one month supply, and it goes to your founders as a gift from Tava Labs.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"tp-love\">\n<style>\n.tp-love{background:#000000;border-radius:16px;padding:28px 30px;margin:34px 0}\n.tp-love h2{color:#D8C19A;margin:0 0 12px}\n.tp-love p{color:#FFFFFF}\n.tp-love ul{padding-left:20px}\n.tp-love li{color:#FFFFFF}\n.tp-love .tv-values__list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;margin-top:22px}\n.tp-love .tv-value{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #B78B45;border-radius:14px;padding:10px 16px}\n.tp-love .tv-value__icon{width:64px;height:64px;flex:0 0 64px;border-radius:50%;object-fit:cover}\n.tp-love .tv-value__name{font-size:18px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.15;color:#000000}\n.tp-love .tv-value__desc{margin:4px 0 0;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.4;color:#000000}\n</style>\n<h2>Why You Will Love It</h2>\n<p>You add more value to your program instantly for your founders and students. The moment someone joins your program or your class or your cohort, they get a free one month supply of PDRN Brightening Serum, free of charge and with no strings attached, as a gift from Tava Labs just for joining.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>More value from day one.</strong> Your program is more valuable from the very first day, with a real product in the hands of your founders and students.</li>\n<li><strong>Zero cost to you.</strong> The serum is a gift from Tava Labs, free of charge and with no strings attached.</li>\n<li><strong>Zero effort to you.</strong> We arrange the free one month supply, and you simply give the gift when they join.</li>\n<li><strong>A gift they will actually use.</strong> A daily routine for founders and students who present themselves in pitches and sales calls and on camera, built around one simple idea. Build your business. Do not neglect yourself.</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"tv-values__list\"><div class=\"tv-value\"><img src=\"/assets/IMG_3162.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Cruelty Free\" class=\"tv-value__icon\"/><div class=\"tv-value__text\"><div class=\"tv-value__name\">Cruelty Free</div><p class=\"tv-value__desc\">Never tested on animals.</p></div></div><div class=\"tv-value\"><img src=\"/assets/IMG_3163.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Fragrance Free\" class=\"tv-value__icon\"/><div class=\"tv-value__text\"><div class=\"tv-value__name\">Fragrance Free</div><p class=\"tv-value__desc\">No added perfumes or synthetic scents.</p></div></div><div class=\"tv-value\"><img src=\"/assets/IMG_3168.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Sulfate Free\" class=\"tv-value__icon\"/><div class=\"tv-value__text\"><div class=\"tv-value__name\">Sulfate Free</div><p class=\"tv-value__desc\">No harsh sulfates — gentle on skin.</p></div></div><div class=\"tv-value\"><img src=\"/assets/IMG_3170.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Alcohol Free\" class=\"tv-value__icon\"/><div class=\"tv-value__text\"><div class=\"tv-value__name\">Alcohol Free</div><p class=\"tv-value__desc\">No drying alcohols.</p></div></div><div class=\"tv-value\"><img src=\"/assets/IMG_3167.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Silicone Free\" class=\"tv-value__icon\"/><div class=\"tv-value__text\"><div class=\"tv-value__name\">Silicone Free</div><p class=\"tv-value__desc\">No silicones coating your skin.</p></div></div><div class=\"tv-value\"><img src=\"/assets/IMG_3166.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Phthalate Free\" class=\"tv-value__icon\"/><div class=\"tv-value__text\"><div class=\"tv-value__name\">Phthalate Free</div><p class=\"tv-value__desc\">No phthalates in the formula.</p></div></div><div class=\"tv-value\"><img src=\"/assets/IMG_3164.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Mineral Oil Free\" class=\"tv-value__icon\"/><div class=\"tv-value__text\"><div class=\"tv-value__name\">Mineral Oil Free</div><p class=\"tv-value__desc\">No mineral oil or petroleum-based fillers.</p></div></div><div class=\"tv-value\"><img src=\"/assets/IMG_3169.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Allergen Free\" class=\"tv-value__icon\"/><div class=\"tv-value__text\"><div class=\"tv-value__name\">Allergen Free</div><p class=\"tv-value__desc\">Made without common allergens.</p></div></div></div>\n</div>\n\n<h2>How a partnership works</h2>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Reach out.</strong> Email us at <a href=\"mailto:talia@tavalabs.app\">talia@tavalabs.app</a> and tell us about your accelerator or incubator or university program or class or portfolio.</li>\n<li><strong>We arrange the gift.</strong> We set up the free one month supply of PDRN Brightening Serum for your students or founders.</li>\n<li><strong>You give the gift.</strong> Your students or founders receive it free of charge and with no strings attached, just for joining, as a gift from Tava Labs.</li>\n</ol>\n\n<div class=\"tp-card\">\n<h2 style=\"margin-top:0\">Start a partnership</h2>\n<p>Email <a href=\"mailto:talia@tavalabs.app\">talia@tavalabs.app</a> or call <a href=\"tel:+19099061308\">909-906-1308</a>. You can also use the Partnerships section on our Contact page.</p>\n<p><a class=\"tp-cta\" href=\"mailto:talia@tavalabs.app\">Email Us About Partnering</a><a class=\"tp-cta alt\" href=\"/contact#partnerships\">Partnerships Contact</a></p>\n</div>\n\n</div></div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n", "headerHtml": "<div class=\"header wf-section\"><div data-collapse=\"medium\" data-animation=\"default\" data-duration=\"0\" data-easing=\"ease\" data-easing2=\"ease\" role=\"banner\" class=\"navigation__wrapper w-nav\"><div data-w-id=\"046f07bb-b329-0abb-be87-d973823280a9\" style=\"background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0)\" class=\"nav__wrappper desktop\"><div class=\"nav__container\"><div class=\"nav__div__left\"><a href=\"/\" class=\"nav__logo__wrap w-nav-brand\"><img src=\"/assets/tava-logo.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"230\" style=\"filter:invert(0%)\" data-w-id=\"046f07bb-b329-0abb-be87-d973823280ad\" alt=\"Tava Labs\" class=\"nav__logo\"/></a></div><div class=\"nav__div__right\"><nav role=\"navigation\" class=\"nav__menu__wrapper w-nav-menu\"><div data-hover=\"1\" data-delay=\"0\" data-w-id=\"046f07bb-b329-0abb-be87-d973823280b0\" class=\"nav__dropdown w-dropdown\"><div class=\"nav__